      "kind": "explain",
      "text": {
        "es": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "Cuando vas peor, unas tablas valen mucho. Hay tres formas de conseguirlas en el tablero. El "
          },
          {
            "kind": "term",
            "id": "perpetual-check",
            "text": "jaque perpetuo"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": ": das "
          },
          {
            "kind": "term",
            "id": "check",
            "text": "jaque"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " una y otra vez y el rival no puede evitarlo. La "
          },
          {
            "kind": "term",
            "id": "threefold-repetition",
            "text": "triple repetición"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": ": si la misma posición se repite tres veces, con el mismo bando a mover, la partida puede acabar en tablas. Y el "
          },
          {
            "kind": "term",
            "id": "stalemate",
            "text": "ahogado"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": ": si el rival te deja sin jugadas legales y tu rey no está en jaque, son tablas."
          }
        ],
        "en": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": "When you are worse, a draw is worth a lot. There are three ways to get one on the board. "
          },
          {
            "kind": "term",
            "id": "perpetual-check",
            "text": "Perpetual check"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": ": you give "
          },
          {
            "kind": "term",
            "id": "check",
            "text": "check"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": " again and again and the rival cannot escape it. "
          },
          {
            "kind": "term",
            "id": "threefold-repetition",
            "text": "Threefold repetition"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": ": if the same position comes up three times, with the same side to move, the game can end in a draw. And "
          },
          {
            "kind": "term",
            "id": "stalemate",
            "text": "stalemate"
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "text": ": if the rival leaves you with no legal move and your king is not in check, it is a draw."
          }
        ]
      },
      "board": {
